,"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-04-06T13:35:51Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/609887001","html_url":"https://github.com/curl/curl/issues/5176#issuecomment-609887001","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/5176","id":609887001,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYwOTg4NzAwMQ==","user":{"login":"bobcozzi","id":7239091,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMzkwOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7239091?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi","html_url":"https://github.com/bobcozzi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-04-06T16:06:43Z","updated_at":"2020-04-06T16:06:43Z","body":"I heard IBM was working on a curl-like native tool but who knows... I think moving it to UTF support would be the right path to take. Let me know if you need access to an IBM i system with v7r3 running. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/609887001/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bobcozzi","id":7239091,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMzkwOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7239091?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi","html_url":"https://github.com/bobcozzi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bobcozzi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/610373376","html_url":"https://github.com/curl/curl/issues/5176#issuecomment-610373376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/5176","id":610373376,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYxMDM3MzM3Ng==","user":{"login":"monnerat","id":227821,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzgyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat","html_url":"https://github.com/monnerat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monnerat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-04-07T13:02:49Z","updated_at":"2020-04-07T13:02:49Z","body":"> I heard IBM was working on a curl-like native tool but who knows...\r\n\r\nCurl support on OS400 is only lthe API library (libcurl) and features an ILE RPG binding: I investigated long ago for a port of the cli tool, but it has far too many options for a `*CMD`: I resigned.\r\n\r\nIt seems strange to me that IBM dropped the `QADRT` header files completely: they always had a particular care of backward support compatibility. I.e.: why keeping the service program if programs using it cannot be recompiled anymore? There should probably be an optional extension for the header files, like the old ascii PRPQ.\r\n\r\n@NattyNarwhal & @bobcozzi : many thanks for your machine access proposal. Since I'm not in the IBM i business anymore (currently unemployed), I would really prefer someone active in it does this new port (note the same problem will arise with libssh2 and libxml2). I'll provide any help I can for this new project. Let's keep the proposal as an extreme alternative solution.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/610373376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"